  <string key="help.number.kicker">随机整数</string>
  <string key="help.number.tagline">在最小值与最大值之间选取一个整数(包含两端)。</string>
  <string key="help.number.step1">输入最小与最大值,投掷会在范围内抽取一个。</string>
  <string key="help.number.step2">点按大数字即可复制到剪贴板。</string>
  <string key="help.number.step3">打开“本次会话不重复”以避免重复值。</string>
  <string key="help.number.tip1">当唯一值耗尽时,会内嵌出现重置按钮。</string>
  <string key="help.number.tip2">支持负数范围 — 例如 -10 … 10。</string>
  <string key="help.dice.kicker">多面体掷骰</string>
  <string key="help.dice.tagline">投掷 1 – 6 颗任意标准面数(D4 – D100)的骰子。</string>
  <string key="help.dice.step1">选择面数与个数。投掷会同时掷出所有骰子。</string>
  <string key="help.dice.step2">结果展示每次掷骰与总和。</string>
  <string key="help.dice.step3">点按结果区域即可复制格式化摘要。</string>
  <string key="help.dice.tip1">骰子面数越大旋转越强 — 可在设置中调整动画。</string>
  <string key="help.coin.kicker">公正 50/50</string>
  <string key="help.coin.tagline">抛掷一枚密码学上公正的硬币,结果为正面或反面。</string>
  <string key="help.coin.step1">按下投掷,硬币会翻转并展示其面。</string>
  <string key="help.coin.step2">点按结果以复制“正面”或“反面”。</string>
  <string key="help.coin.tip1">长时间无偏 — 适合真实的抽签。</string>
  <string key="help.picker.kicker">多中取一</string>
  <string key="help.picker.tagline">从你的列表中随机挑选一项。</string>
  <string key="help.picker.step1">在编辑区内每行输入一个项目。</string>
  <string key="help.picker.step2">投掷会像轮盘一样在其中切换并定格在一项上。</string>
  <string key="help.picker.step3">点按结果以仅复制被选中的项。</string>
  <string key="help.picker.tip1">重复行会被加权 — 同一个名字添加两次,概率翻倍。</string>
  <string key="help.password.kicker">基于 CSPRNG</string>
  <string key="help.password.tagline">从已启用的字符类别生成一个安全密码。</string>
  <string key="help.password.step1">用滑杆设置长度(8 – 64)。</string>
  <string key="help.password.step2">根据需要启用 A / a / 1 / !@# 各类。</string>
  <string key="help.password.step3">投掷以生成,点按以复制 — 密码不会保存。</string>
  <string key="help.password.tip1">“排除易混字符”会移除 0、O、1、l、I、|。</string>
  <string key="help.password.tip2">至少保留一类 — 最后一个选项会自动锁定。</string>
  <string key="help.color.kicker">全光谱</string>
  <string key="help.color.tagline">生成一个随机颜色,并以便于复制的格式显示。</string>
  <string key="help.color.step1">用格式选择器选择 HEX、RGB 或 HSL。</string>
  <string key="help.color.step2">投掷以抽取新颜色,色块填满整个结果区。</string>
  <string key="help.color.step3">点按色块以所选格式复制数值。</string>
  <string key="help.color.tip1">标签颜色会根据亮度自动在黑白之间切换。</string>
  <string key="help.shuffle.kicker">重新排序</string>
  <string key="help.shuffle.tagline">以随机顺序返回你的列表。至少需要 2 项。</string>
  <string key="help.shuffle.step1">在编辑区内每行输入一个项目。</string>
  <string key="help.shuffle.step2">投掷会将其打乱成新顺序。</string>
  <string key="help.shuffle.step3">点按结果以换行分隔的形式复制整张打乱后的列表。</string>
  <string key="help.shuffle.tip1">使用由安全 RNG 支持的 Fisher–Yates 算法。</string>
